{"id":"3599837ce283bc86","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-set-hereditarily-finite.md","title":"ZFC Set Hereditarily Finite","display":"df-zfc-set-hereditarily-finite — ZFC Set Hereditarily Finite","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set-hereditarily-finite","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set-hereditarily-finite"],"display":"df-zfc-set-hereditarily-finite — ZFC Set Hereditarily Finite","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-set-v-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set-hereditarily-finite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set-hereditarily-finite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set-hereditarily-finite — ZFC Set Hereditarily Finite"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed994f150d5fc2f9\" href=\"?note=ed994f150d5fc2f9\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-set-v-omega\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-set-v-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span> (set candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetVOmega}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetVOmega}_S\\)</span> (predicate defining the unique cumulative stage <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\omega\">\\(V_\\omega\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetHereditarilyFinite}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetHereditarilyFinite}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}hereditarily\\text{-}finite} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetHereditarilyFinite}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow \\exists H\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSetVOmega}_S(H)\\land x\\in H\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}hereditarily\\text{-}finite} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetHereditarilyFinite}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow \\exists H\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSetVOmega}_S(H)\\land x\\in H\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This uses the upstream predicate for the cumulative stage instead of treating the undeclared expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\omega\">\\(V_\\omega\\)</span> as a primitive constant.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-set-v-omega","status":"resolved","id":"ed994f150d5fc2f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-set-v-omega]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetVOmega}_S","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetHereditarilyFinite}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}hereditarily\\text{-}finite} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetHereditarilyFinite}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow \\exists H\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSetVOmega}_S(H)\\land x\\in H\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"V_\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":913,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3364","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-set-hereditarily-finite.md|58-df-zfc-set-hereditarily-finite]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["ed994f150d5fc2f9"]}